     ("The 1-3-1's corners are open because:", "Only one defender covers the whole baseline", "The top defender is high", "The middle three are wide", "It traps"),
     ("The 3-2's low post is open because:", "Three defenders are committed to the top, leaving two for the whole inside", "The baseline is long", "It traps", "The guards are small"),
